m.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9WaXJhYXRhcGFsZW0lMjBQQyUyME1lZW5hJTIwUmVwb3J0aW5nJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.3","title":"Staking It All","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2025-06-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Meena tries to register a case about Malli’s mysterious death but is put on hold. Meanwhile, the village president asks Meena to marry his son and is stunned by her reply.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a2l1N6PiRliXxkUZBwtUu6AVFgy.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9WaXJhYXRhcGFsZW0lMjBQQyUyME1lZW5hJTIwUmVwb3J0aW5nJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.4","title":"Encounter With The Truth","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2025-06-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The wedding festivities for Meena and the president’s son begin, while the villagers fear the curse will strike. Meena collapses but counters by filing a case, declaring herself a victim.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aaV5Vvelqva36XrQiRVvFvEe4YF.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9WaXJhYXRhcGFsZW0lMjBQQyUyME1lZW5hJTIwUmVwb3J0aW5nJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.5","title":"Forever Bride","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2025-06-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Meena launches an investigation, determined to unravel the mystery behind the deaths. As she digs deeper, her wedding gets abruptly called off. Her investigation takes her to a point of no return.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c4jCs95J8tkrZNHwdCKl7hnb4dR.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9WaXJhYXRhcGFsZW0lMjBQQyUyME1lZW5hJTIwUmVwb3J0aW5nJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.6","title":"The Last Straw","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2025-06-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Meena’s investigation gets pushed back due to a transfer order. On her visit to the headquarters, she discovers that Narsayya recommended her transfer. Sensing foul play, Meena digs into his past.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wxQTE7SMMzHpxMEPiAayFI8P1pb.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9WaXJhYXRhcGFsZW0lMjBQQyUyME1lZW5hJTIwUmVwb3J0aW5nJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.7","title":"Mystery of Viraatapalem","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2025-06-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Meena helps two villagers get married with support from the village president, despite everyone's fear of the curse. Can Meena expose the real culprit behind the deaths before another life is lost?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kEODz5saRiyuQ192cbzuMEGtajq.jpg"}]}}